IMPORT prelude
IMPORT domain

-- g4-council-work.l4: Law 5785-2025, sections 24 to 28: the saving of the Council's acts, its quorum, majority and casting vote,
-- deliberation in an incomplete composition, advisers and procedure, its functions and subcommittees, remuneration, and the
-- status equation with State employees.  (PLAN put s.24 beside s.20 to s.23; it is here because s.24 and s.25(a) count the same base.)
-- Group G4 (the Registrar and the Council), written by ENCODER G4.  Source: inputs/law.wiki, cited as src:N (quotation lines are
-- copied by script, work/g4/build.py); checked against the gazette (Sefer HaChukim 3349, pp. 187-189).  English beside the Hebrew is
-- the encoder's paraphrase; the Hebrew governs.
--
-- This module DECIDES the interface IP7: `s 24 to 26 — the Council's advice was validly given` and `s 26 — the Council was consulted`
-- (G1, G2, G3 and g4-registrar take the answers as BOOLEAN inputs named `the Council was consulted` and
-- `the Council's advice was validly given`; the INTEGRATOR wires them).
-- Imports only prelude and domain: no date is counted in these sections.  The number of seats (eleven) is s.20's and is restated here
-- as `s 24, s 25(a) — the number of members of the Council under section 20`; g4-tests-council-work.l4 asserts it equals the seat count of
-- g4-council-membership.l4, so the two texts of one number cannot drift apart.

§ `Chapter 4: the Registrar and the Council`

§§ `Sections 24 to 28: how the Council works`

§§§ `The acts of these sections, and the facts they ask about`

DECLARE `An act under sections 24 to 28` IS ONE OF
    `use an adviser or an expert to help form the Council's position` HAS
        actor IS A Party
        `the adviser or expert` IS A STRING
        `the adviser or expert can help` IS A BOOLEAN
    `fix the Council's working methods and procedures` HAS
        actor IS A Party
    `advise the Minister on exempting classes of work from the licence` HAS
        actor IS A Party
    `advise the Registrar on the Ministry's policy` HAS
        actor IS A Party
    `advise the Registrar on an individual application or decision` HAS
        actor IS A Party
        `the matter` IS A STRING
    `perform another function the Law gives the Council` HAS
        actor IS A Party
        `the function` IS A STRING
    `appoint a subcommittee to advise the Council` HAS
        actor IS A Party
        `the subcommittee` IS A STRING
    `delegate the Council's powers in the function of section 26(a)(3) to a subcommittee` HAS
        actor IS A Party
        `the subcommittee` IS A STRING

-- The four functions of s.26(a), numbered as the Law numbers them.
DECLARE `Function of the Council under section 26(a)` IS ONE OF
    `function (1): advising the Minister on exemption from licensing`
    `function (2): advising the Registrar on the Ministry's policy`
    `function (3): advising the Registrar on individual applications and decisions`
    `function (4): any other function the Law gives the Council`

@desc One member of the Council who is serving on the day of a meeting
DECLARE `Serving member of the Council` HAS
    `reference for the member` IS A STRING @desc Any stable identifier for the member
    `the member is the chair` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True for the one serving member who holds the chair's seat (s.20(1))

@desc One meeting of the Council: who was serving, who was summoned, who was present and how they voted
DECLARE `Meeting of the Council` HAS
    `members serving on the day of the meeting` IS A LIST OF `Serving member of the Council` @desc Every serving member, whether or not present; a member whose appointment was defective is serving (s.24)
    `every member was duly summoned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if every serving member was duly summoned to the discussion (s.25(c)); a vacant seat has no member to summon
    `references of the members present` IS A LIST OF STRING @desc The references of the members who attended, serving or not
    `references of the members who voted for` IS A LIST OF STRING @desc The references of the members who voted for the proposal; a member who attended and is in neither vote list abstained
    `references of the members who voted against` IS A LIST OF STRING @desc The references of the members who voted against; no member is in both vote lists

@desc Where a piece of the Council's advice came from
DECLARE `Source of the Council's advice` IS ONE OF
    `the Council at a meeting` HAS
        `the meeting` IS A `Meeting of the Council`
    `a subcommittee that advises the Council` HAS
        `the Council delegated its powers in the function to the subcommittee` IS A BOOLEAN
        `the subcommittee proceeded as the procedure fixed by the Council requires` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN

@desc A consultation of the Council: the function it falls under, whether it was requested, and who gave the advice, if anyone has
DECLARE `Consultation of the Council` HAS
    `the function the consultation falls under` IS A `Function of the Council under section 26(a)` @desc Which function of s.26(a)
    `a request for the Council's advice was made` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the Minister or the Registrar asked the Council for its advice
    `the source of the advice, if any has been given` IS A MAYBE `Source of the Council's advice` @desc NOTHING if no advice has been given yet

@desc A member's employment, for s.27 and s.28: the four employee classes the sections speak of
DECLARE `Employment of a member of the Council` HAS
    `a State employee` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the member is a State employee (the Budget Principles Law, s.32, an external definition: an input)
    `an employee of a budgeted body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the member is an employee of a budgeted body (external definition, an input)
    `an employee of a supported body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the member is an employee of a supported body (external definition, an input)
    `an employee of the body the member represents on the Council` IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the member is employed by the very body the member represents on the Council

-- The six enactments of s.28, one constructor each; what each enactment says is outside this encoding and is an input to anyone who needs it.
DECLARE `Enactment named in section 28` IS ONE OF
    `the Public Service (Gifts) Law 1979`
    `the Penal Law, the provisions concerning public servants`
    `the Public Service (Restrictions after Retirement) Law 1969`
    `the Civil Service (Restriction of Party Activity and Fund-raising) Law 1959, the provisions on all State employees`
    `the Evidence Ordinance, the provisions on a public servant's certificate`
    `the Knesset Elections Law`

§§§ `Named refusals`

-- Each refusal is returned, never stored (an unforced REFUSE is no refusal); the name is the message.

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`s 25(b) gives the casting vote to the chair's opinion; the votes are equal and the chair cast none, which the text does not answer` MEANS
    REFUSE "s 25(b) gives the casting vote to the chair's opinion; the votes are equal and the chair cast none, which the text does not answer"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`s 25(e) leaves the working methods of a subcommittee to the Council; the Council fixed none that the sources show, so whether the subcommittee proceeded validly is not answered` MEANS
    REFUSE "s 25(e) leaves the working methods of a subcommittee to the Council; the Council fixed none that the sources show, so whether the subcommittee proceeded validly is not answered"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`s 27 says nothing about the entitlement of a supported-body employee who is not an employee of the body represented on the Council` MEANS
    REFUSE "s 27 says nothing about the entitlement of a supported-body employee who is not an employee of the body represented on the Council"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`s 27(a) says nothing about payment to a member who is a State, budgeted-body or supported-body employee` MEANS
    REFUSE "s 27(a) says nothing about payment to a member who is a State, budgeted-body or supported-body employee"

§§§ `Section 24: the saving of the Council's acts`

-- "מכהנים בה רוב חבריה ובהם יושב ראש המועצה": a majority of its members serve, the chair among them.  FORK F-base (see s.25(a)):
-- "its members" is the eleven statutory seats (s.20).  Under the alternative base (the members serving) this proviso would be a
-- tautology ("a majority of the members serving serve"), which is why the eleven are taken for both s.24 and s.25(a).
-- src:166 | {{ח:ת}} השר ימנה מועצה בת 11 חברים, שתמלא את התפקידים שנקבעו לה לפי חוק זה, וזה הרכבה:
@ref s.20 (src:166)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 24, s 25(a) — the number of members of the Council under section 20` MEANS 11

-- "רוב": more than half.
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
      n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 24, s 25(a) — a count of` x `is a majority of` n MEANS
    (x TIMES 2) GREATER THAN n

-- src:198 | {{ח:ת}} קיום המועצה, סמכויותיה ותוקף החלטותיה ופעולותיה לא ייפגעו בשל הפסקת כהונתו של חבר מחברי המועצה או מחמת ליקוי במינויו או בהמשך כהונתו, ובלבד שמכהנים בה רוב חבריה ובהם יושב ראש המועצה.
@ref s.24 (src:198)
@export Whether the saving of section 24 applies to the Council's acts: a majority of the eleven members, including the chair, are serving, so a vacancy or a defect in a member's appointment does not impair the Council's existence, powers, decisions or acts
GIVEN serving IS A LIST OF `Serving member of the Council` @desc The members serving on the day, including any whose appointment or continued service is defective
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 24 — the saving of the Council's acts applies` serving MEANS
        `s 24, s 25(a) — a count of` (count serving) `is a majority of` `s 24, s 25(a) — the number of members of the Council under section 20`
    AND any (GIVEN m YIELD m's `the member is the chair`) serving

§§§ `Section 25(a): the quorum`

GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council`
GIVETH A LIST OF `Serving member of the Council`
`s 25(a) — the serving members present at` meeting MEANS
    filter (GIVEN m YIELD elem (m's `reference for the member`) (meeting's `references of the members present`)) (meeting's `members serving on the day of the meeting`)

-- "המניין החוקי בישיבות המועצה הוא רוב חבריה ובהם יושב ראש המועצה": the quorum is a majority of its members, the chair among them.
-- FORK F-base.  Reading taken: "its members" are the eleven seats of s.20, so the quorum is six, as s.24's own "רוב חבריה" requires.
-- Only serving members count: a person who attends and is not a serving member is not a member present.
-- src:201 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} המניין החוקי בישיבות המועצה הוא רוב חבריה ובהם יושב ראש המועצה.
@ref s.25(a) (src:201)
@export Whether a meeting of the Council has a quorum: a majority of its eleven members were present, the chair among them
GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council` @desc The meeting: who was serving and who was present
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 25(a) — the meeting has a quorum` meeting MEANS
        `s 24, s 25(a) — a count of` (count (`s 25(a) — the serving members present at` meeting)) `is a majority of` `s 24, s 25(a) — the number of members of the Council under section 20`
    AND any (GIVEN m YIELD m's `the member is the chair`) (`s 25(a) — the serving members present at` meeting)

-- FORK F-base, alternative: "its members" are the members serving on the day, so with vacancies the quorum falls.
-- src:201 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} המניין החוקי בישיבות המועצה הוא רוב חבריה ובהם יושב ראש המועצה.
@ref s.25(a) (src:201)
GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 25(a), alternative reading — the meeting has a quorum, a majority of the members serving being enough` meeting MEANS
        `s 24, s 25(a) — a count of` (count (`s 25(a) — the serving members present at` meeting)) `is a majority of` (count (meeting's `members serving on the day of the meeting`))
    AND any (GIVEN m YIELD m's `the member is the chair`) (`s 25(a) — the serving members present at` meeting)

§§§ `Section 25(b): decisions, and the chair's casting vote`

GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 25(b) — the number of serving members present who voted for, at` meeting MEANS
    count (filter (GIVEN m YIELD elem (m's `reference for the member`) (meeting's `references of the members who voted for`)) (`s 25(a) — the serving members present at` meeting))

GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 25(b) — the number of serving members present who voted against, at` meeting MEANS
    count (filter (GIVEN m YIELD elem (m's `reference for the member`) (meeting's `references of the members who voted against`)) (`s 25(a) — the serving members present at` meeting))

GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 25(b) — the chair voted for, at` meeting MEANS
    any (GIVEN m YIELD (m's `the member is the chair`) AND elem (m's `reference for the member`) (meeting's `references of the members who voted for`)) (`s 25(a) — the serving members present at` meeting)

GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 25(b) — the chair voted against, at` meeting MEANS
    any (GIVEN m YIELD (m's `the member is the chair`) AND elem (m's `reference for the member`) (meeting's `references of the members who voted against`)) (`s 25(a) — the serving members present at` meeting)

-- "החלטות המועצה יתקבלו ברוב דעות החברים המשתתפים והמצביעים בישיבה; היו הדעות שקולות, תכריע דעתו של יושב ראש המועצה":
-- a majority of the members who take part and vote (an abstainer is not counted); on a tie the chair's opinion decides.
-- A tie in which the chair cast no vote is the one case the text does not answer: a named refusal, never FALSE.
-- src:202 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} החלטות המועצה יתקבלו ברוב דעות החברים המשתתפים והמצביעים בישיבה; היו הדעות שקולות, תכריע דעתו של יושב ראש המועצה.
@ref s.25(b) (src:202)
GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 25(b) — the votes carry the proposal at` meeting MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `s 25(b) — the number of serving members present who voted for, at` meeting GREATER THAN `s 25(b) — the number of serving members present who voted against, at` meeting THEN TRUE
        IF `s 25(b) — the number of serving members present who voted against, at` meeting GREATER THAN `s 25(b) — the number of serving members present who voted for, at` meeting THEN FALSE
        IF `s 25(b) — the chair voted for, at` meeting THEN TRUE
        IF `s 25(b) — the chair voted against, at` meeting THEN FALSE
        OTHERWISE `s 25(b) gives the casting vote to the chair's opinion; the votes are equal and the chair cast none, which the text does not answer`

-- FORK F-25b-tie, alternative: a tie in which the chair cast no vote simply fails the proposal (no majority is no decision), instead of being unanswered.
-- src:202 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} החלטות המועצה יתקבלו ברוב דעות החברים המשתתפים והמצביעים בישיבה; היו הדעות שקולות, תכריע דעתו של יושב ראש המועצה.
@ref s.25(b) (src:202)
GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 25(b), alternative reading — a tie in which the chair cast no vote fails the proposal, at` meeting MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `s 25(b) — the number of serving members present who voted for, at` meeting GREATER THAN `s 25(b) — the number of serving members present who voted against, at` meeting THEN TRUE
        IF `s 25(b) — the number of serving members present who voted against, at` meeting GREATER THAN `s 25(b) — the number of serving members present who voted for, at` meeting THEN FALSE
        IF `s 25(b) — the chair voted for, at` meeting THEN TRUE
        OTHERWISE FALSE

-- A decision needs the quorum of (a).
-- src:201 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} המניין החוקי בישיבות המועצה הוא רוב חבריה ובהם יושב ראש המועצה.
-- src:202 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} החלטות המועצה יתקבלו ברוב דעות החברים המשתתפים והמצביעים בישיבה; היו הדעות שקולות, תכריע דעתו של יושב ראש המועצה.
@ref s.25(a) (src:201)
@ref s.25(b) (src:202)
@export Whether the Council's decision is carried at a meeting: there is a quorum under section 25(a) and the proposal has a majority of those present and voting under section 25(b), the chair's opinion deciding a tie
GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council` @desc The meeting, with who was serving, present and voting how
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 25(a), (b) — the Council's decision is carried at the meeting` meeting MEANS
        `s 25(a) — the meeting has a quorum` meeting
    AND `s 25(b) — the votes carry the proposal at` meeting

§§§ `Section 25(c): deliberation in an incomplete composition (trap T28)`

-- "המועצה רשאית לדון בהרכב חסר, ובלבד שכל חבריה זומנו כדין לדיון ושבדיון נכח לפחות יושב ראש המועצה": the Council may DELIBERATE
-- when every member was duly summoned and at least the chair attended.  Whether it may then DECIDE is not said (T28).
-- Reading A (taken): (c) permits discussion only; a decision still needs the quorum of (a).  The text uses "לדון" (deliberate) here and
-- "החלטות" (decisions) in (b), and (a) fixes "המניין החוקי" (the legal quorum) for meetings.
-- src:203 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} המועצה רשאית לדון בהרכב חסר, ובלבד שכל חבריה זומנו כדין לדיון ושבדיון נכח לפחות יושב ראש המועצה.
@ref s.25(c) (src:203)
GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 25(c) — the Council may deliberate in an incomplete composition` meeting MEANS
        meeting's `every member was duly summoned`
    AND any (GIVEN m YIELD m's `the member is the chair`) (`s 25(a) — the serving members present at` meeting)

-- FORK F-T28, alternative reading B: (c) relaxes (a), so a meeting that may deliberate under (c) may also decide, by the majority of (b).
@ref s.25(c) (src:203)
GIVEN meeting IS A `Meeting of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 25(c), alternative reading — the Council's decision is carried at a meeting held in an incomplete composition` meeting MEANS
        `s 25(c) — the Council may deliberate in an incomplete composition` meeting
    AND `s 25(b) — the votes carry the proposal at` meeting

§§§ `Section 25(d): advisers and experts`

-- "רשאית להיעזר ביועצים ובמומחים שיש בהם כדי לסייע, לפי שיקול דעתה": a MAY, at the Council's own discretion; the adviser must be one who can help.
-- src:204 | {{ח:תת|(ד)}} המועצה רשאית להיעזר ביועצים ובמומחים שיש בהם כדי לסייע, לפי שיקול דעתה, לגיבוש עמדתה.
@ref s.25(d) (src:204)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 24 to 28`
`s 25(d) — the Council may use advisers and experts who can help form its position` MEANS
    PARTY `the Council`
    MAY `use an adviser or an expert to help form the Council's position` `the Council` adviser TRUE

§§§ `Section 25(e): the Council's own procedure`

-- "המועצה תקבע את דרכי עבודתה וסדרי דיוניה אם לא נקבעו לפי חוק זה": a duty (תקבע) that arises only for matters the Law does not fix.
-- No time is stated.  The Council's rules are not in the sources.
-- src:205 | {{ח:תת|(ה)}} המועצה תקבע את דרכי עבודתה וסדרי דיוניה אם לא נקבעו לפי חוק זה.
@ref s.25(e) (src:205)
GIVEN `the Law fixes the matter` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 24 to 28`
`s 25(e) — the Council must fix its working methods and procedures where the Law has not` `the Law fixes the matter` MEANS
    IF   `the Law fixes the matter`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the Council`
         MUST `fix the Council's working methods and procedures` `the Council`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY `the Council` BECAUSE "s 25(e): the Council did not fix its working methods and procedures"

§§§ `Section 26(a): the functions`

-- FORK F-26a: the "תפקידים" (functions) are read as duties of the Council ("שתמלא את התפקידים שנקבעו לה", s.20: that shall fill the functions
-- fixed for it), so each is a MUST with no time.  The alternative reads them as powers (MAY).
-- src:209 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} לייעץ לשר לעניין מתן פטור מרישיון למבצעי עבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר, מסוגים מסוימים;
@ref s.26(a)(1) (src:209)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 24 to 28`
`s 26(a)(1) — the Council must advise the Minister on exempting classes of work on cooling systems from the licence` MEANS
    PARTY `the Council`
    MUST `advise the Minister on exempting classes of work from the licence` `the Council`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the Council` BECAUSE "s 26(a)(1): the Minister was not advised on exemption from licensing"

-- src:210 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} לייעץ לרשם לעניין מדיניות המשרד, לרבות בכל הנוגע להכרה בתעודות, בתארים ובהכשרות ממוסדות לימודים במדינות חוץ, לסירוב לחדש רישיונות, להתניית חידוש רישיונות בהשתתפות בהשתלמויות, לביטול רישיונות, להגבלתם, להתלייתם או להארכת תקופת תוקפם;
@ref s.26(a)(2) (src:210)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 24 to 28`
`s 26(a)(2) — the Council must advise the Registrar on the Ministry's policy` MEANS
    PARTY `the Council`
    MUST `advise the Registrar on the Ministry's policy` `the Council`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the Council` BECAUSE "s 26(a)(2): the Registrar was not advised on the Ministry's policy"

-- (3) includes recognition of foreign qualifications and the refusal, conditioning, revocation, restriction, suspension or extension of
-- a licence ("לרבות"): an illustration, so every individual application or decision of the Registrar is within it.
-- src:211 | {{ח:תתת|(3)}} לייעץ לרשם בבקשות פרטניות, לרבות הכרה בתעודה, בתואר או בהכשרה ממוסד לימודים במדינת חוץ, סירוב לחדש רישיון, התניית חידוש רישיון בהשתתפות בהשתלמות, ביטול רישיון, הגבלתו, התלייתו או הארכת תקופת תוקפו;
@ref s.26(a)(3) (src:211)
GIVEN matter IS A STRING
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 24 to 28`
`s 26(a)(3) — the Council must advise the Registrar on an individual application or decision` matter MEANS
    PARTY `the Council`
    MUST `advise the Registrar on an individual application or decision` `the Council` matter
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the Council` BECAUSE "s 26(a)(3): the Registrar was not advised on the individual application or decision"

-- src:212 | {{ח:תתת|(4)}} למלא כל תפקיד אחר שהוטל עליה בחוק.
@ref s.26(a)(4) (src:212)
GIVEN function IS A STRING
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 24 to 28`
`s 26(a)(4) — the Council must perform any other function the Law gives it` function MEANS
    PARTY `the Council`
    MUST `perform another function the Law gives the Council` `the Council` function
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the Council` BECAUSE "s 26(a)(4): a function the Law gives the Council was not performed"

-- FORK F-26a, alternative: the functions are powers.
-- src:208 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} תפקידי המועצה הם:
@ref s.26(a) (src:208)
GIVEN function IS A `Function of the Council under section 26(a)`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 24 to 28`
`s 26(a), alternative reading — the Council may perform the function` function MEANS
    CONSIDER function
    WHEN `function (1): advising the Minister on exemption from licensing` THEN
        PARTY `the Council` MAY `advise the Minister on exempting classes of work from the licence` `the Council`
    WHEN `function (2): advising the Registrar on the Ministry's policy` THEN
        PARTY `the Council` MAY `advise the Registrar on the Ministry's policy` `the Council`
    WHEN `function (3): advising the Registrar on individual applications and decisions` THEN
        PARTY `the Council` MAY `advise the Registrar on an individual application or decision` `the Council` matter
    WHEN `function (4): any other function the Law gives the Council` THEN
        PARTY `the Council` MAY `perform another function the Law gives the Council` `the Council` other

§§§ `Section 26(b): subcommittees and delegation`

-- src:213 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} המועצה רשאית למנות, מקרב חבריה או מי שאינו נמנה עם חבריה, ועדות משנה שייעצו לה בעניין תפקידיה, ולעניין תפקידה לפי סעיף קטן (א)(3) – רשאית המועצה לאצול לוועדת משנה את סמכויותיה.
-- "המועצה רשאית למנות, מקרב חבריה או מי שאינו נמנה עם חבריה, ועדות משנה שייעצו לה": a MAY; members or outsiders alike.
@ref s.26(b) (src:213)
GIVEN subcommittee IS A STRING
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 24 to 28`
`s 26(b) — the Council may appoint a subcommittee, from its members or from outside, to advise it` subcommittee MEANS
    PARTY `the Council`
    MAY `appoint a subcommittee to advise the Council` `the Council` subcommittee

-- "ולעניין תפקידה לפי סעיף קטן (א)(3) – רשאית המועצה לאצול לוועדת משנה את סמכויותיה": only for the (a)(3) function.  The grant of
-- the power to delegate names (a)(3) and no other (FORK F-26b: the power to delegate is not read into the others).
@ref s.26(b) (src:213)
GIVEN function IS A `Function of the Council under section 26(a)`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 26(b) — the Council may delegate its powers in the function to a subcommittee` function MEANS
    function EQUALS `function (3): advising the Registrar on individual applications and decisions`

@ref s.26(b) (src:213)
GIVEN function IS A `Function of the Council under section 26(a)`
      subcommittee IS A STRING
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under sections 24 to 28`
`s 26(b) — the Council's power to delegate its powers in the function to the subcommittee` function subcommittee MEANS
    IF   `s 26(b) — the Council may delegate its powers in the function to a subcommittee` function
    THEN PARTY `the Council`
         MAY `delegate the Council's powers in the function of section 26(a)(3) to a subcommittee` `the Council` subcommittee
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§§ `Sections 24 to 26: the Council was consulted, and its advice was validly given (IP7)`

-- "The Council was consulted": a request for its advice was made to it.
-- src:208 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} תפקידי המועצה הם:
-- src:209 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} לייעץ לשר לעניין מתן פטור מרישיון למבצעי עבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר, מסוגים מסוימים;
-- src:210 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} לייעץ לרשם לעניין מדיניות המשרד, לרבות בכל הנוגע להכרה בתעודות, בתארים ובהכשרות ממוסדות לימודים במדינות חוץ, לסירוב לחדש רישיונות, להתניית חידוש רישיונות בהשתתפות בהשתלמויות, לביטול רישיונות, להגבלתם, להתלייתם או להארכת תקופת תוקפם;
-- src:211 | {{ח:תתת|(3)}} לייעץ לרשם בבקשות פרטניות, לרבות הכרה בתעודה, בתואר או בהכשרה ממוסד לימודים במדינת חוץ, סירוב לחדש רישיון, התניית חידוש רישיון בהשתתפות בהשתלמות, ביטול רישיון, הגבלתו, התלייתו או הארכת תקופת תוקפו;
-- src:212 | {{ח:תתת|(4)}} למלא כל תפקיד אחר שהוטל עליה בחוק.
@ref s.26(a) (src:208-212)
@export Whether the Council was consulted: a request for its advice was made to it (IP7, the input named `the Council was consulted`)
GIVEN consultation IS A `Consultation of the Council` @desc The consultation, its function, the request, and the advice if any
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 26 — the Council was consulted` consultation MEANS
    consultation's `a request for the Council's advice was made`

-- The Council's advice was validly given when it is the Council's decision, carried at a quorate meeting (s.25), or, for the function of
-- s.26(a)(3) only, the advice of a subcommittee to which the Council delegated its powers (s.26(b)) that proceeded as the procedure
-- fixed by the Council requires (s.25(e)).  A subcommittee that advises on any other function does not give the Council's advice.
-- FORK F-26-sub: whether a subcommittee's advice satisfies a "consultation with the Council" for the functions other than (3) is not
-- answered by the text; reading taken: not.  The alternative accepts delegated advice for every function.

GIVEN procedure IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 25(e) — the subcommittee's procedure was as the Council fixed it, if it fixed one` procedure MEANS
    CONSIDER procedure
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `s 25(e) leaves the working methods of a subcommittee to the Council; the Council fixed none that the sources show, so whether the subcommittee proceeded validly is not answered`
    WHEN JUST proceededProperly THEN proceededProperly

-- src:208 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} תפקידי המועצה הם:
-- src:209 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} לייעץ לשר לעניין מתן פטור מרישיון למבצעי עבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר, מסוגים מסוימים;
-- src:210 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} לייעץ לרשם לעניין מדיניות המשרד, לרבות בכל הנוגע להכרה בתעודות, בתארים ובהכשרות ממוסדות לימודים במדינות חוץ, לסירוב לחדש רישיונות, להתניית חידוש רישיונות בהשתתפות בהשתלמויות, לביטול רישיונות, להגבלתם, להתלייתם או להארכת תקופת תוקפם;
-- src:211 | {{ח:תתת|(3)}} לייעץ לרשם בבקשות פרטניות, לרבות הכרה בתעודה, בתואר או בהכשרה ממוסד לימודים במדינת חוץ, סירוב לחדש רישיון, התניית חידוש רישיון בהשתתפות בהשתלמות, ביטול רישיון, הגבלתו, התלייתו או הארכת תקופת תוקפו;
-- src:212 | {{ח:תתת|(4)}} למלא כל תפקיד אחר שהוטל עליה בחוק.
-- src:213 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} המועצה רשאית למנות, מקרב חבריה או מי שאינו נמנה עם חבריה, ועדות משנה שייעצו לה בעניין תפקידיה, ולעניין תפקידה לפי סעיף קטן (א)(3) – רשאית המועצה לאצול לוועדת משנה את סמכויותיה.
@ref s.24 to s.26 (src:208-213)
GIVEN source IS A `Source of the Council's advice`
      function IS A `Function of the Council under section 26(a)`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 24 to 26 — the advice of` source `on` function `is valid advice of the Council` MEANS
    CONSIDER source
    WHEN `the Council at a meeting` meeting THEN `s 25(a), (b) — the Council's decision is carried at the meeting` meeting
    WHEN `a subcommittee that advises the Council` delegated procedure THEN
            (function EQUALS `function (3): advising the Registrar on individual applications and decisions`)
        AND delegated
        AND `s 25(e) — the subcommittee's procedure was as the Council fixed it, if it fixed one` procedure

@ref s.24 to s.26 (src:208-213)
GIVEN source IS A `Source of the Council's advice`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 24 to 26, alternative reading — whatever the function, valid advice of the Council is the advice that comes from` source MEANS
    CONSIDER source
    WHEN `the Council at a meeting` meeting THEN `s 25(a), (b) — the Council's decision is carried at the meeting` meeting
    WHEN `a subcommittee that advises the Council` delegated procedure THEN
            delegated
        AND `s 25(e) — the subcommittee's procedure was as the Council fixed it, if it fixed one` procedure

@ref s.24 to s.26 (src:208-213)
@export Whether the Council's advice was validly given (IP7, the input named `the Council's advice was validly given`): a request was made and the advice is the Council's decision carried at a quorate meeting, or the delegated advice of a subcommittee on an individual application
GIVEN consultation IS A `Consultation of the Council` @desc The consultation and the source of the advice
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 24 to 26 — the Council's advice was validly given` consultation MEANS
        consultation's `a request for the Council's advice was made`
    AND `the advice given, if any, is valid` consultation
    WHERE
        `the advice given, if any, is valid` c MEANS
            CONSIDER c's `the source of the advice, if any has been given`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST source THEN `s 24 to 26 — the advice of` source `on` (c's `the function the consultation falls under`) `is valid advice of the Council`

@ref s.24 to s.26 (src:208-213)
GIVEN consultation IS A `Consultation of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 24 to 26, alternative reading — the Council's advice was validly given, a subcommittee's delegated advice sufficing for every function` consultation MEANS
        consultation's `a request for the Council's advice was made`
    AND `the advice given, if any, is valid` consultation
    WHERE
        `the advice given, if any, is valid` c MEANS
            CONSIDER c's `the source of the advice, if any has been given`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST source THEN `s 24 to 26, alternative reading — whatever the function, valid advice of the Council is the advice that comes from` source

§§§ `Section 27: remuneration and expenses`

-- (a) a member who is not a State, budgeted-body or supported-body employee: no payment for taking part, but a refund of reasonable travel
-- expenses ("בהתאם להוראות של החשב הכללי": the amount follows the Accountant General's instructions, an external input).
-- (b) a member who is a State employee, a budgeted-body employee or an employee of the body he represents: no refund "as stated in (a)".
-- src:216 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} חבר המועצה שאינו עובד המדינה, עובד גוף מתוקצב או עובד גוף נתמך, לא יהיה זכאי לתשלום מאת המשרד בעד השתתפות בישיבות המועצה, אך יהיה זכאי לקבל החזר הוצאות נסיעה סבירות שהוציא לצורך השתתפותו בישיבות המועצה, בהתאם להוראות של החשב הכללי במשרד האוצר החלות לעניין חברי ועדות ציבוריות; בסעיף זה, ”עובד המדינה“, ”עובד גוף מתוקצב“ ו”עובד גוף נתמך“ – כהגדרתם {{ח:חיצוני|חוק יסודות התקציב#סעיף 32|בסעיף 32 לחוק יסודות התקציב, התשמ״ה–1985}}.
@ref s.27(a) (src:216)
GIVEN employment IS AN `Employment of a member of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 27(a) — the member is not a State, budgeted-body or supported-body employee` employment MEANS
        (NOT employment's `a State employee`)
    AND (NOT employment's `an employee of a budgeted body`)
    AND (NOT employment's `an employee of a supported body`)

-- src:217 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} חבר המועצה שהוא עובד המדינה, עובד גוף מתוקצב או עובד באותו גוף שהוא מייצג במועצה, לא יהיה זכאי להחזר הוצאות כאמור בסעיף קטן (א).
@ref s.27(b) (src:217)
GIVEN employment IS AN `Employment of a member of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 27(b) — the member is a State employee, a budgeted-body employee or an employee of the body the member represents` employment MEANS
        employment's `a State employee`
    OR  employment's `an employee of a budgeted body`
    OR  employment's `an employee of the body the member represents on the Council`

-- CONTRADICTION C-27 (see FRAGMENT-G4.md): (a) entitles any member outside the three classes, (b) denies the refund to an employee of the
-- body he represents; a member who works for a private body he represents and is none of the three classes is entitled under (a) and
-- denied under (b).  Reading taken: (b) prevails, since it speaks of the refund "as stated in (a)" and so carves out of it.
-- GAP G-27: a supported-body employee who is not an employee of the body represented is outside (a)'s entitlement and outside (b)'s
-- denial, so the text gives no answer: a named refusal.
-- src:216 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} חבר המועצה שאינו עובד המדינה, עובד גוף מתוקצב או עובד גוף נתמך, לא יהיה זכאי לתשלום מאת המשרד בעד השתתפות בישיבות המועצה, אך יהיה זכאי לקבל החזר הוצאות נסיעה סבירות שהוציא לצורך השתתפותו בישיבות המועצה, בהתאם להוראות של החשב הכללי במשרד האוצר החלות לעניין חברי ועדות ציבוריות; בסעיף זה, ”עובד המדינה“, ”עובד גוף מתוקצב“ ו”עובד גוף נתמך“ – כהגדרתם {{ח:חיצוני|חוק יסודות התקציב#סעיף 32|בסעיף 32 לחוק יסודות התקציב, התשמ״ה–1985}}.
-- src:217 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} חבר המועצה שהוא עובד המדינה, עובד גוף מתוקצב או עובד באותו גוף שהוא מייצג במועצה, לא יהיה זכאי להחזר הוצאות כאמור בסעיף קטן (א).
@ref s.27 (src:216-217)
@export Whether a Council member is entitled to a refund of reasonable travel expenses for attending meetings: (a) gives it to a member outside the State, budgeted-body and supported-body classes, (b) denies it to a State or budgeted-body employee or an employee of the body represented; a supported-body employee outside (b) is not answered
GIVEN employment IS AN `Employment of a member of the Council` @desc The member's employment
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 27 — the member is entitled to a refund of reasonable travel expenses` employment MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `s 27(b) — the member is a State employee, a budgeted-body employee or an employee of the body the member represents` employment THEN FALSE
        IF `s 27(a) — the member is not a State, budgeted-body or supported-body employee` employment THEN TRUE
        OTHERWISE `s 27 says nothing about the entitlement of a supported-body employee who is not an employee of the body represented on the Council`

-- CONTRADICTION C-27, the alternative reading: (a) prevails over (b) for a member outside the three classes who works for the body he represents.
@ref s.27 (src:216-217)
GIVEN employment IS AN `Employment of a member of the Council`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 27, alternative reading — the member is entitled to a refund of reasonable travel expenses, section 27(a) prevailing` employment MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `s 27(a) — the member is not a State, budgeted-body or supported-body employee` employment THEN TRUE
        IF `s 27(b) — the member is a State employee, a budgeted-body employee or an employee of the body the member represents` employment THEN FALSE
        OTHERWISE `s 27 says nothing about the entitlement of a supported-body employee who is not an employee of the body represented on the Council`

-- "לא יהיה זכאי לתשלום מאת המשרד בעד השתתפות בישיבות המועצה": a member of the (a) class is not entitled to payment.  For the other
-- members the text says nothing.
@ref s.27(a) (src:216-217)
@export Whether a Council member is entitled to payment from the Ministry for taking part in meetings: section 27(a) says no for a member who is not a State, budgeted-body or supported-body employee; it is silent for the others
GIVEN employment IS AN `Employment of a member of the Council` @desc The member's employment
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 27(a) — the member is entitled to payment from the Ministry for taking part in meetings` employment MEANS
    IF   `s 27(a) — the member is not a State, budgeted-body or supported-body employee` employment
    THEN FALSE
    ELSE `s 27(a) says nothing about payment to a member who is a State, budgeted-body or supported-body employee`

§§§ `Section 28: the status equation`

-- src:220 | {{ח:ת}} חברי המועצה שאינם עובדי המדינה, דינם כדין עובדי המדינה, לעניין חיקוקים אלה ולעניין פעולותיהם במועצה:
-- "חברי המועצה שאינם עובדי המדינה, דינם כדין עובדי המדינה, לעניין חיקוקים אלה ולעניין פעולותיהם במועצה": members who are not State employees are
-- treated as State employees for these enactments and for their acts in the Council.  FORK F-28-scope.  Reading A (taken): both: the listed
-- enactment AND an act in the Council.  Items (2), (4) and (5) reach only the provisions they name, an input.  Reading B: the listed enactment
-- whatever the act.  The text of the six enactments is outside this encoding.
@ref s.28 (src:220)
GIVEN e IS AN `Enactment named in section 28`
      named IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 28 — the provision of` e `reaches the member, the provision being one the item names:` named MEANS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `the Penal Law, the provisions concerning public servants` THEN named
    WHEN `the Civil Service (Restriction of Party Activity and Fund-raising) Law 1959, the provisions on all State employees` THEN named
    WHEN `the Evidence Ordinance, the provisions on a public servant's certificate` THEN named
    OTHERWISE TRUE

@ref s.28 (src:220)
@export Whether a Council member is treated as a State employee under a named enactment (section 28): a member who is not a State employee is, for the six listed enactments and for the member's acts in the Council; items 2, 4 and 5 only for the provisions they name
GIVEN employment IS AN `Employment of a member of the Council` @desc The member's employment; only whether the member is a State employee is read
      enactment IS AN `Enactment named in section 28` @desc Which of the six enactments
      actInCouncil IS A BOOLEAN @desc True if the act is an act of the member in the Council
      provisionNamed IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the Penal Law, the Civil Service (party activity) Law and the Evidence Ordinance: True if the provision is of the kind the item names; ignored for the other three
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 28 — the member with the employment` employment `is treated as a State employee under` enactment `for an act in the Council being` actInCouncil `and a provision the item names being` provisionNamed MEANS
        employment's `a State employee`
    OR  (    actInCouncil
         AND `s 28 — the provision of` enactment `reaches the member, the provision being one the item names:` provisionNamed)

-- FORK F-28-scope, alternative B: the listed enactment applies to the member whatever the act.
@ref s.28 (src:220)
GIVEN employment IS AN `Employment of a member of the Council`
      enactment IS AN `Enactment named in section 28`
      provisionNamed IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 28, alternative reading — the member with the employment` employment `is treated as a State employee under` enactment `whatever the act, a provision the item names being` provisionNamed MEANS
        employment's `a State employee`
    OR  `s 28 — the provision of` enactment `reaches the member, the provision being one the item names:` provisionNamed
